Derived work: Cadence
---------------------

Wavyzon is a Rust rewrite of Cadence (https://github.com/relateful/Cadence), a
standalone audio node for Discord bots written in Go. Its architecture, wire
protocol, configuration and behaviour (two-deck mixing, the frame-accurate
wire clock, DAVE end-to-end encryption, the Lavalink v4 compatible API) follow
Cadence, and parts of Wavyzon were translated from Cadence's source code.

