Third-party components
----------------------

Wavyzon depends on third-party Rust crates and, in builds that link it
statically, on the Opus codec (libopus, BSD 3-Clause, built from source by the
audiopus_sys crate). Each of these keeps its own license and copyright; they
are not relicensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. The license of every crate is
declared in its Cargo.toml and can be listed with `cargo deny list` or
`cargo license`. The licenses accepted for dependencies are listed in
deny.toml.


